# ===== Items: File menu =====
item_save => Save config (JSON)
item_exit => Exit editor

# ===== Descriptions =====
desc_anim => Pick an animation from the list to edit; it plays back automatically
desc_anim_name => Name of this animation inside the config JSON
desc_prefix => Frame prefix of this animation inside the atlas XML
desc_note_data => Note data column this animation belongs to (0=Left 1=Down 2=Up 3=Right)
desc_indices => Only use the given frame indices of the prefix (comma separated; empty = all frames)
desc_min_fps => Minimum playback FPS for this animation (random lower bound)
desc_max_fps => Maximum playback FPS for this animation (random upper bound)
desc_anim_add => Write (or update) the current parameters into the animation list
desc_anim_remove => Remove the current animation from the list
desc_anim_reset => Clear the current config and restore the default template
desc_image => Splash atlas path (under images/, e.g. noteSplashes/noteSplashes)
desc_reload_image => Reload the atlas & config using the entered path
desc_scale => Overall splash scale
desc_allow_rgb => Allow the RGB tint shader
desc_allow_pixel => Allow pixelated rendering on pixel stages
desc_template => Start over with a blank config (add animations one by one)
desc_convert_txt => Read a legacy .txt splash config and save it as JSON
desc_target => Choose which replacement channel you are editing
desc_target_red => Edit the replacement color of the red channel
desc_target_green => Edit the replacement color of the green channel
desc_target_blue => Edit the replacement color of the blue channel
desc_r => Red component of the replacement color
desc_g => Green component of the replacement color
desc_b => Blue component of the replacement color
desc_no_replace => When checked, this target channel is not replaced
desc_reset_rgb => Reset all three replacement colors to zero
desc_save => Save the current config as JSON (next to the atlas)
desc_exit => Exit the Note Splash editor and return to the master editor menu

# ===== Help rows =====
item_help_click => Click a note or press SPACE to spawn a splash
item_help_offset => Arrow keys nudge the offset
item_help_shift => Hold Shift: offset steps x10
item_help_copy => Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V / Ctrl+R: copy / paste / reset offset
item_help_fps => Every 4 note datas add another set of animations
item_help_f1 => Open this help menu: F1
item_help_exit => Exit editor: ESC / Back

# ===== Help row descriptions =====
desc_help_click => Click any note below, or press SPACE on the Animation page to preview a splash
desc_help_offset => Arrow keys nudge the current animation offset by 1px
desc_help_shift => While held, arrow keys move by 10px (auto-repeat)
desc_help_copy => Ctrl+C copies the current offset, Ctrl+V pastes, Ctrl+R resets to zero
desc_help_fps => The next set of animation names is generated every 4 note datas
desc_help_f1 => Open this help menu: F1
desc_help_exit => Exit back to the master editor menu: ESC / Back
